          <div class="idea-grid">
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 01 · Charades</div>
              <h3>🎭 Category-Spin Charades</h3>
              <p>
                Spin for the category, then draw from that pile. Nobody gets
                stuck with, or picks, the easy one.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Movies, Animals, Jobs, Sports, Fairy tales</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 02 · Truth or Dare</div>
              <h3>🤫 Two-Wheel Truth or Dare</h3>
              <p>
                One wheel for players, one for the theme. Nobody can always
                pick "dare." Keep it family-friendly, or start from the
                <a href="/truth-or-dare-wheel">truth or dare wheel</a>.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Silly, Food, School, Dream, Talent</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 03 · Drawing</div>
              <h3>🎨 Random Prompt Drawing</h3>
              <p>
                Spin once, everyone draws the same prompt for two minutes, then
                the family votes on the funniest result.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> A dragon doing yoga, a sandwich in space, a robot baker</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 04 · Trivia</div>
              <h3>🧠 Spin-the-Category Trivia</h3>
              <p>
                Each team spins before answering, so nobody can cherry-pick an
                easy category.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Science, History, Pop culture, Sport, Geography</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 05 · Karaoke</div>
              <h3>🎤 Wheel-Assigned Songs</h3>
              <p>
                Mix easy anthems with trickier picks and spin for the singer's
                song. Try the <a href="/music-genre-wheel">music genre wheel</a>
                to set the mood first.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Pop hit, Disney, Oldies, Rock, Family favorite</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 06 · Card games</div>
              <h3>🃏 Random Card Game Picker</h3>
              <p>
                Load every card game you know and spin between rounds to keep
                the evening moving.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Go Fish, Uno, Rummy, Snap, Crazy Eights</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 07 · Turn order</div>
              <h3>🏆 Fair Turn Picker</h3>
              <p>
                Add every player and turn on "remove after spin" to set the
                whole order in one go. For bigger groups, the
                <a href="/team-picker-wheel">team picker wheel</a> helps.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Each player's name</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 08 · Board games</div>
              <h3>🎲 Which Board Game Tonight?</h3>
              <p>
                Put every game on the shelf on the wheel and agree beforehand
                that the pick stands.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Your actual board games, one slice each</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="box box-success">
            <div class="box-label">For mixed-age groups</div>
            <p>
              Use the wheel to hand out small handicaps: younger kids spin for
              a bonus clue, older players spin for a shorter time limit. It
              keeps everyone competitive without changing the game itself.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 id="ideas-creative">Formats Built Around the Wheel</h2>
          <p>
            These are not classic games with a wheel bolted on. The wheel is
            how each one works.
          </p>

          <div class="idea-grid">
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 09 · Dinner</div>
              <h3>🍕 The Dinner Decision Wheel</h3>
              <p>
                Before the games start, spin for what you order or cook from a
                shortlist everyone accepts. The
                <a href="/food-picker-wheel">food picker wheel</a> and our
                <a href="/blogs/what-to-eat-tonight-spin-wheel-dinner-decision">dinner decision guide</a>
                help.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 10 · Movie</div>
              <h3>🎬 Movie Roulette Half-Time</h3>
              <p>
                Spin for a genre mid-evening, using the
                <a href="/movie-genre-wheel">movie genre wheel</a>, so the
                anticipation builds through the games.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 11 · Forfeits</div>
              <h3>💪 Fitness Forfeit Wheel</h3>
              <p>
                Small physical challenges for whoever loses a round, instead of
                a points penalty. Keep them quick and safe.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> 10 jumping jacks, wall sit for 15 seconds, balance on one foot, silly walk</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 12 · Prizes</div>
              <h3>🎁 End-of-Night Prize Draw</h3>
              <p>
                Each win earns a spin on a prize wheel, which is a transparent
                way to reward the evening. See our
                <a href="/blogs/how-to-run-online-giveaway">guide to fair prize draws</a>.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Choose the next movie, skip a chore, pick dessert</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 13 · Teams</div>
              <h3>🧩 Team Generator</h3>
              <p>
                Add everyone's names and use "remove after spin" to alternate
                people onto Team A and Team B. No awkward picking dynamic.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 14 · Storytelling</div>
              <h3>📝 Story Round Robin</h3>
              <p>
                One wheel picks who adds the next sentence; a second adds a
                twist. The results are reliably absurd.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Twists:</b> Add a villain, jump ten years, introduce a pet, it starts raining</div>
            </div>
          </div>

