          <h2 id="ideas-quick">Quick Extras for Any Night</h2>
          <p>
            Short additions that fit between bigger games or when you only have
            twenty minutes.
          </p>

          <div class="idea-grid">
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 15 · Snacks</div>
              <h3>🍿 Snack Roulette</h3>
              <p>
                Spin for tonight's snack from a list a parent has pre-approved.
                Check for allergies before adding anything.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Popcorn, fruit plate, mini pizzas, nachos, ice-cream</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 16 · Scavenger hunt</div>
              <h3>🔎 Living Room Scavenger Hunt</h3>
              <p>
                Spin for an item to find in two minutes. Remove each item after
                it is found.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Something red, something soft, something round, something older than you</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 17 · Would you rather</div>
              <h3>🤔 Would You Rather Wheel</h3>
              <p>
                Load pairs of silly choices. The spin picks who answers first
                and the rest of the family votes.
              </p>
              <div class="entries"><b>Entries:</b> Fly or turn invisible, always hot or always cold</div>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 18 · Word round</div>
              <h3>🔤 Letter Round</h3>
              <p>
                Spin the <a href="/letter-picker-wheel">letter picker wheel</a>
                and race to name an animal, food and country starting with that
                letter.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 19 · Emoji charades</div>
              <h3>😀 Emoji Charades</h3>
              <p>
                Spin the <a href="/emoji-picker-wheel">emoji picker wheel</a>
                and act out the emoji that lands, with no talking allowed.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="idea-card">
              <div class="idea-num">Idea 20 · Number guess</div>
              <h3>🔢 Number Guessing Rounds</h3>
              <p>
                Spin the <a href="/number-picker-wheel">number picker wheel</a>
                and whoever guesses closest before the reveal wins the round.
                It is also a fair way to decide who goes first.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 id="age-groups">Matching Ideas to Ages</h2>
          <p>Not every format suits every age mix. A quick reference:</p>

